  "entry": "code/README.md",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A web front end to the SWEET-Cat catalogue of host-star parameters (Teff, logg, [Fe/H], mass and more). You can search and sort the table, open a page for each star with its planets, plot stellar and planetary parameters against each other, and download the catalogue. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
